 "sweep_id": "snn_screen_1",
 "description": "First screen of the fully spiking CNN + LIF (model family 3b, plan 4.4): convolutions with LIF neurons after each and max pooling of spikes, then 0 to 2 spiking linear layers and the leaky-integrator readout. Encoding: each log-mel frame one step (\"frames\", the base) or the whole image repeated 4 or 8 steps (\"repeat\"). Features at a 20 ms hop (50 steps a second) with time masks of 10 frames, 4 s training crops; otherwise the training settings of the CNN + Transformer's base. Neurons as in cnn_lif_screen_1. Stages as in cnn_lif_screen_1. Validation only.",
